QuestGuidance.Register("es",291,{
[9281]="7003A692\n1\tDefeat Dunlending Labourers (0/12) Defeat White Hand Warriors (0/8)\tMate Isernore was once a mine owned by Gifemund, but was conquered by a group of White Hand from Madh-fushaum.\n2\tDefeat Dunlending Labourers (total: 12)\030Defeat White Hand Warriors (total: 8)\tThe Dunlendings, being of the lowest rank, seem responsible for most of the manual labour. The Orc warriors are aiding their efforts or performing guard duty.\n3\tCompletado\tThe workers are defeated and the mining operations in Mate Isernore have all but ceased.\n",
[9282]="70046C26\n1\tCollect horsetail seeds (total: 6)\030Collect oxlip seeds (total: 6)\030Collect vetchling seeds (total: 6)\tSeeds can be found on the Field of Cormallen and in the surrounding woods. Ereblen has asked you to gather many seeds from the Field of Cormallen and then plant them in the lowlands of North Ithilien.\n2\tPlant the seeds in fertile soil in North Ithilien (total: 6)\tFertile soil can be found in the lowlands of North Ithilien to the west and south of Henneth Annûn. You have gathered many seeds and should now plant them throughout North Ithilien.\n3\tTalk to Ereblen\tEreblen can be found to the west of Henneth Annûn. You have planted many seeds and should now return to Ereblen.\n",
[9283]="70028C91\n1\tLlévale las órdenes a Ardwyn en Puente del Cuarto\tArdwyn se encuentra en Puente del Cuarto, al norte de Brôntrig Deberías llevarle a Ardwyn las órdenes que has encontrado sin demora.\n",
[9284]="70036FD1\n1\tTBD\t\n",
[9285]="7004DA73\n1\tDestroy river nets (total: 10)\tRiver nets can be found along the Forest River between Loeglond and Felegoth. An enemy of the North has been using river nets to steal shipments from Felegoth to Loeglond beneath the notice of the Elves. You should destroy the river nets before more shipments are stolen.\n2\tTalk to Lorndúr\tLorndúr can be found in Loeglond. You should talk to Lorndúr.\n",
[9286]="700075B4\n1\tHabla con Gillemin Brandigamo en el Bosque Viejo\tEl campamento de Gillemin Brandigamo está a cierta distancia al sureste en el Bosque Viejo, más allá de la Colina del viejo Muddyfoot. Toly Tejonera te pidió que buscaras el consejo de un viejo guardabosques llamado Gillemin Brandigamo.\n",
[9287]="70067EEA\n1\tMake your way through the fort to feed the hungry workers and spread coin to those who have become dispirited with the work and schedules they must maintain.\t\n2\tTell Beliash you did as he asked\tYour work is done. Head back to Beliash in Rakhatâb and let him know what you have done.\n",
[9288]="70044639\n1\tSpeak with Dervorin upon the wall of the Second Circle\tDervorin will meet you upon the wall near the Wainrider's Head on the Second Circle of Minas Tirith. You should climb up on top the wall of the Second Circle to meet with Dervorin.\n2\tLook towards Mount Mindolluin\tDervorin can be found upon the wall near the Wainrider's Head on the Second Circle of Minas Tirith. You should look towards Mount Mindolluin with Dervorin.\n3\tSpeak with Dervorin\tDervorin can be found upon the wall near the Wainrider's Head on the Second Circle of Minas Tirith. You should speak with Dervorin.\n",
[9289]="70044647\n1\tLook at the fire\tThe brazier sits next to Rossaran. You should look at the flames.\n2\tSpeak with Rossaran\tRossaran can be found in the Court of Tarondor on the First Circle of Minas Tirith. You should speak with Rossaran.\n",
[9290]="70046BB0\n1\tTell Morgul lurkers of the King's return (total: 8)\030Defeat Morgul lurkers (total: 4)\tMorgul lurkers can be found in the wooded land south of the after-battle Cross-roads. You should proclaim the King's return to any Morgul Orcs lurking nearby.\n2\tTalk to Angbor\tYou should talk to Angbor, who can be found at the after-battle Cross-roads.\n",
[9291]="70034D80\n1\tCuéntale a Cyneberg la historia de Iothete\tCyneberg se encuentra en el escondite de los refugiados al suroeste de Dunfast. Debes apresurarte al escondite de los refugiados para contarle a Cyneberg el extraño encuentro de Iothete y la piedra que escondió en su casa.\n2\tDile a Cyneberg que debe llevar a los refugiados a Forlaw\tCyneberg está en el escondite de los refugiados. Debes decirle a Cyneberg que debe regresar a Forlaw contigo.\n3\tApresúrate a Forlaw para contarle a Gárwig todo lo que sabes\tGárwig está en el Salón Solitario, el Salón del Hidromiel de Forlaw. Debes regresar con Gárwig y contarle todo lo que Iothete te dijo.\n",
[9292]="700169B8\n1\tHabla con Kúli en el Agujero Chirriante\tKuli está en el Agujero Chirriante, al sureste de Guardia Orca. Róarr te ha pedido que encuentres a Kúli en el Agujero Chirriante y le des las noticias de la muerte de Nykr.\n",
[9293]="70032C2C\n1\tToma la cabra de Knakk para ir al campamento de Kúli y hablar con él sobre el medallón\tLa cabra de Knakk está junto a él.\\ n La cabra de Knakk puede llevarte de forma segura hasta el campamento de Kúli, cerca de la colmena de gredbyg en la caverna meridional de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo. Knakk te ha pedido que busques a Kúli, le des la noticia de la muerte de Kafli y le pidas que traduzca el antiguo texto enano que se encuentra dentro del medallón.\n",
[9294]="70052B1A\n1\tDeliver Amelina's trinket to Atta\tAtta can be found in Hultvís. You have discovered a trinket bearing the name of Atta's long-deceased sister, Amelina. You should deliver it to Atta at once.\n2\tFind Radagast in Hultvís\tRadagast can be found somewhere in Hultvís. After Radagast came to Hultvís, he spoke to Atta about the Snatcher. Overcome with emotion at the return of his sister's trinket, Atta has vowed to spend his remaining days travelling Middle-earth.\n3\tHabla con Radagast\tRadagast can be found standing beside Ríkmar in Hultvís. You have found Radagast in Hultvís and should now speak to him.\n",
[9295]="70017612\n1\tAyuda a Mallas en sus esfuerzos en la Sala Decimosexta\030Ayuda a Mallas en sus esfuerzos en Skûmfil\030Ayuda a Throstur en sus esfuerzos en Skûmfil\030Ayuda a Gelirwen en sus esfuerzos en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas\tMallas, Throstur y Gelirwen se encuentran en el Refugio Sombrío, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera. Veúlfur desea comprender mejor al enemigo que surge de los confines de la oscuridad. Te ha enviado al Refugio Sombrío para ayudar a sus agentes y aliados con diversas tareas destinadas a esclarecer los peligros y la naturaleza de la criatura maligna que allí se oculta.\n2\tRegresa con Veúlfur a la Sala Vigesimoprimera\tVeúlfur se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noroeste del Refugio Sombrío. Has ayudado con éxito a todos los agentes de Veúlfur en el Refugio Sombrío, ganándote su honor y respeto.\n",
[9296]="700190EB\n1\tRecoge flores de elanor (total: 6)\030Recoge flores de niphredil (total: 6)\tElanor y niphredil pueden encontrarse sobre la colina de Cerin Amroth y a su alrededor. Tuilinn te ha pedido que recojas elanor y niphredil.\n2\tLleva flores a Maliriel en el Embarcadero\030Lleva flores a Ambendel en Echad Andestel\030Lleva flores a Bahanneth en Talan Fanuidhol\tBahanneth está en Talan Fanuidhol, al oeste de Cerin Amroth. Ambendel se encuentra en Echad Andestel, al suroeste de Cerin Amroth. Maliriel está en el Embarcadero, al este y al sur de Cerin Amroth, junto al río. Tuilinn te ha pedido que lleves flores de elanor y niphredil a Bahanneth, Ambendel y Maliriel, la Maestra del Festín.\n3\tHabla con Tuilinn en Cerin Amroth\tTuilinn se encuentra en lo alto de la plataforma en Cerin Amroth. Deberías regresar junto a Tuilinn y contarle cómo su regalo ha levantado el ánimo de sus amigos.\n",
[9297]="7006CE14\n1\tDefeat Sakhârshag\tExplore the ancient, crumbling ziggurat-tombs of pale stone known as Nirgambâr. Follow Andur's path deeper within the ancient tomb.\n2\tDefeat Imanak-tûr\tAndur's path leads you deeper into Nirgambâr. Who knows what might lie in wait next?\n3\tDefeat Aratûg\tTravelling deeper within Nirgambâr has revealed several ancient creatures. Who or what lies in the central chamber?\n",
[9298]="7006CE15\n1\tDefeat Sakhârshag\tExplore the ancient, crumbling ziggurat-tombs of pale stone known as Nirgambâr. Follow Andur's path deeper within the ancient tomb.\n2\tDefeat Imanak-tûr\tAndur's path leads you deeper into Nirgambâr. Who knows what might lie in wait next?\n3\tDefeat Aratûg\tTravelling deeper within Nirgambâr has revealed several ancient creatures. Who or what lies in the central chamber?\n",
[9299]="7006CF78\n1\tDefeat Sakhârshag\tExplore the ancient, crumbling ziggurat-tombs of pale stone known as Nirgambâr. Follow Andur's path deeper within the ancient tomb.\n2\tDefeat Imanak-tûr\tAndur's path leads you deeper into Nirgambâr. Who knows what might lie in wait next?\n3\tDefeat Aratûg\tTravelling deeper within Nirgambâr has revealed several ancient creatures. Who or what lies in the central chamber?\n",
[9300]="7006CF79\n1\tDefeat Sakhârshag\tExplore the ancient, crumbling ziggurat-tombs of pale stone known as Nirgambâr. Follow Andur's path deeper within the ancient tomb.\n2\tDefeat Imanak-tûr\tAndur's path leads you deeper into Nirgambâr. Who knows what might lie in wait next?\n3\tDefeat Aratûg\tTravelling deeper within Nirgambâr has revealed several ancient creatures. Who or what lies in the central chamber?\n",
[9301]="70018FC2\n1\tRecoge un fardo de flechas junto a Celegúien\tCelegúien tiene un fardo de flechas para que lo recojas en las cajas junto a ella en Echad Andestel. Quiere que se las lleves a Meredhrandir en el campamento de Mekhem-bizru, muy cerca de la entrada de Moria. Te aconsejó que siguieras el camino hacia el oeste y luego al norte a través de Nanduhirion, y que tengas cuidado con los orcos en la ruta. Se te ha pedido que entregues flechas desde Echad Andestel hasta Mekhem-bizru.\n2\tHabla con Meredhrandir\tMeredhrandir se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, justo en la entrada oriental de Moria. Has llevado un fardo de flechas a Meredhrandir y deberías hablar con él sobre el viaje.\n",
[9302]="70046C3D\n1\tTalk to Jarl Gurthilm\t\n2\tTalk to Jarl Gurthilm\tJarl Gurthilm can be found among his company on the banks of the Anduin in south-western North Ithilien. You have encountered a familiar party of Variags camped within North Ithilien and should speak to their Jarl.\n3\tMeet Jarl Gurthilm at the Field of Cormallen\tThe Field of Cormallen can be found far to the north in the north-western reaches of North Ithilien. Jarl Gurthilm has asked you to keep the Orcs and Easterlings in North Ithilien at bay as he and his men travel. He expects a report on your efforts near the Field of Cormallen.\n4\tSearch for Jarl Gurthilm's company near the Field of Cormallen\tJarl Gurthilm and his company must be somewhere nearby the Field of Cormallen. You have arrived at the Field of Cormallen, but the Variags are nowhere to be found. You should search nearby for Jarl Gurthilm's company.\n5\tTalk to Jarl Gurthilm\tJarl Gurthilm and his company can be found to the east of the Field of Cormallen. You have found Jarl Gurthilm and his company and should now speak to him.\n",
[9303]="7002BFAD\n1\tHabla con el líder de los Orientales en su campamento de Juncal.\tEl campamento de los Orientales se encuentra al sur del campamento de los Hombres del Bosque, en Juncal. Amal te ha pedido que hables con el líder de los Orientales en el Juncal y lo convenzas de que no representan una amenaza.\n2\tHabla con Amal en el campamento de los Hombres del Bosque, en Juncal.\tAmal está en el campamento de los Hombres del Bosque, al norte del campamento de los Orientales, en Juncal Debes regresar con Amal llevando la advertencia de Nafrati.\n",
[9304]="70037E74\n1\tHabla con el Thane Edric\tThane Edric can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade in eastern Kingstead. Agelman has asked that you speak to Edric on his behalf about remaining in Entwade to combat the White Hand forces.\n2\tTalk to Agelman\tAgelman can be found at your side or can be rallied to you by using your horn. Thane Edric has denied Agelman in his request to remain in Entwade and battle alongside the other warriors. You should now speak to Agelman about what is to be done next.\n3\tFind a sword in Entwade\030Find a shield in Entwade\tA sword and shield can be found scattered about Entwade. Agelman has asked that you arm him. He believes a sword can be found near the training dummies, and a shield can be found near the stable-master.\n4\tTalk to Agelman\tAgelman can be found at your side or can be rallied with your horn. You have recovered a sword and shield for Agelman at his request, and should now return them to his keeping.\n",
[9305]="70032B96\n1\tDestruye tiendas orcas (total: 5)\030Destruye las barricadas (total: 3)\tPuedes encontrar tiendas orcas y barricadas en Mudmul-charâf, un pasaje en el noroeste de Zelem-melek. Deberías destruir las construcciones y defensas improvisadas de los orcos.\n2\tCompletado\tHas destruido las construcciones y defensas del enemigo en Mudmul-charâf.\n",
[9306]="70058FCC\n1\tDefeat goblin-assassins on the battlefield around Zudramdân (total: 6)\tGundabad goblin-assassins can be found on the battlefield around Zudramdân. Goblin-assassins of Gundabad stalk the battlefield around Zudramdân and seek to put an end to unwary dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ. You should defeat them.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have defeated many of the goblin-assassins of Gundabad stalking the battlefield around Zudramdân.\n",
[9307]="700272C6\n1\tLos almacenes están en chozas y torres por todas las Tierras del Rebaño, no muy lejos del escondite de Blodwen. Es probable que las teas encendidas usadas por el Clan del Dragón para conquistar la granja estén cerca de las chozas. Debes incendiar los almacenes de semillas para que no puedan seguir abasteciendo al Clan del Dragón.\t\n2\tRegresa con Blodwen en las Tierras del Rebaño\tBlodwen todavía permanece en su escondite, esperando que la muerte la reúna con su nueva familia. Debes decirle a Blodwen que destruiste lo que quedaba de la granja.\n",
[9308]="70027327\n1\tDerrota a los sapos y raspa el residuo de sus pieles (total: 4)\tSe pueden encontrar sapos en todo Tâl Methedras, en la orilla lejana del lago y en la isla en medio del agua. Iwan te ha pedido que recojas un poco del residuo de la piel de los sapos en Tâl Methedras.\n2\tLleva el residuo de sapo a Iwan\tIwan está sentado en la orilla del lago, cerca del huerto de Tûr Morva. Has recogido residuo de los sapos de Tâl Methedras y deberías llevárselo a Iwan.\n3\tHabla con Maelona en Tûr Morva\tMaelona está frente a su casa, en la entrada de Tûr Morva. Iwan ha probado por error la sustancia de sapo con la que quiere recubrir las armas del clan Halcón y ahora está enfermo. Te ha enviado a la curandera Maelona para que le traigas algo que lo cure.\n4\tLleva el polvo de raíz a Iwan\tIwan está en la orilla del lago, cerca de los huertos de Tûr Morva. Maelona te ha dado un poco de polvo que debería curar a Iwan de su malestar digestivo.\n",
[9309]="70040047\n1\tDestroy tents\tTents can be found all over the bandit encampment as the bandits have attempted to set up a comfortable living space for themselves. You should destroy the tents of the bandits who so cruelly wounded and robbed Fuirion.\n2\tDestroy tents (total: 8)\tTents can be found all over the bandit encampment as the bandits have attempted to set up a comfortable living space for themselves. You should destroy the tents of the bandits who so cruelly wounded and robbed Fuirion.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have destroyed a number of bandit tents in the encampment.\n",
[9310]="70035206\n1\tAtiende los cadáveres de los hombres de Byre Tor (total: 8)\tHay hombres muertos esparcidos por toda la ciudad de Byre Tor. Deberías dar descanso a los muertos, pues no deberían quedar expuestos como trofeos de los orcos.\n2\tCompletado\tHas dado descanso a muchos de los antiguos habitantes de Byre Tor.\n",
[9311]="70058BBB\n1\tFree captured dwarves at Bagûd-mekhem (total: 8)\tCaptured dwarves can be found at Bagûd-mekhem. After receiving word that dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ have been captured and brought to Bagûd-mekhem, Dréri hopes to see them freed before they are slain. You should free captured dwarves at Bagûd-mekhem.\n2\tTalk to Dréri at Drenghól\tDréri can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks. You have freed a number of captured dwarves at Bagûd-mekhem. You should report your success to Dréri.\n",
[9312]="70037CA7\n1\tDefeat fleeing Orcs near the Entwash (total: 8)\tOrcs can be found to the south of Entwade near the shores of the river Entwash. Thane Edric's guard, Magenred, has asked you to slay Orcs that have fled into Kingstead from the Sutcrofts.\n2\tHabla con el Thane Edric\tThane Edric can be found in the Mead Hall of Entwade in eastern Kingstead. You have defeated the remainder of Orc forces that fled into the Westemnet. You should inform Thane Edric of your success.\n",
})
